* COMET behavioural models (LTspice and ngspice)
*
* COMET_OPAMP: open-loop gain 1e4, gain-bandwidth about 1 GHz,
* output limited to 0.02 ... 4.95 V (single 5 V supply).
* Stand-in for the LMH6629 until the vendor model is added.
.subckt COMET_OPAMP inp inn out
G1 0 x inp inn 1m
Rx x 0 10Meg
Cx x 0 0.159p
B1 o 0 V=max(0.02, min(4.95, V(x)))
Ro o out 10
.ends COMET_OPAMP
*
* COMET_CMP: comparator with a 3.3 V output, about 3 mV transition width.
* Stand-in for the TLV3501.
.subckt COMET_CMP inp inn out
B1 out 0 V=1.65*(1+tanh((V(inp)-V(inn))/0.003))
.ends COMET_CMP
